          ],
          "changeMeaning": "Switch to XeF4 to show Square Planar geometry derived from Octahedral",
          "narration": "Xenon tetrafluoride (XeF4) also has 6 electron domains, but two are lone pairs. To minimize repulsion between these large lone pairs, they position themselves opposite one another. The four remaining bonds form a flat, square planar molecular geometry."
